"b4-048-001","sourceIndex":0,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,15],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"How does the older investor differ in his approach to investment from the younger investor?","start":12.38,"end":18.0,"score":0.979,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-048-002","sourceId":"b4-048-002","sourceIndex":1,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,10],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"There is no shortage of tipsters around offering 'get-rich-quick' opportunities.","start":20.55,"end":25.55,"score":0.99,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-048-003","sourceId":"b4-048-003","sourceIndex":2,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,19],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"But if you are a serious private investor, leave the Las Vegas mentality to those with money to fritter.","start":26.26,"end":33.26,"score":0.937,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-048-004","sourceId":"b4-048-004","sourceIndex":3,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,20],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The serious investor needs a proper 'portfolio' --a well-planned selection of investments, with a definite structure and a clear aim.","start":33.863,"end":43.15,"score":0.969,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-048-005","sourceId":"b4-048-005","sourceIndex":4,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,14],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"But exactly how does a newcomer to the stock market go about achieving that?","start":43.703,"end":48.84,"score":0.992,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-048-006-p01","sourceId":"b4-048-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":1,"parts":3,"wordRange":[0,19],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Well, if you go to five reputable stock brokers and ask them what you should do with your money,","start":49.89,"end":56.4,"score":0.986,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-048-006-p02","sourceId":"b4-048-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":2,"parts":3,"wordRange":[19,37],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"you're likely to get five different answers, --  even if you give all the relevant information about your age,","start":56.683,"end":64.01,"score":0.955,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-048-006-p03","sourceId":"b4-048-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":3,"parts":3,"wordRange":[37,46],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"family, finances and what you want from your investments.","start":64.26,"end":68.04,"score":0.989,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-048-007","sourceId":"b4-048-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,1],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Moral?","start":68.91,"end":69.54,"score":0.99,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-048-008","sourceId":"b4-048-008","sourceIndex":7,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,10],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"There is no one 'right' way to structure a portfolio.","start":69.782,"end":73.12,"score":0.974,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-048-009-p01","sourceId":"b4-048-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":1,"parts":3,"wordRange":[0,7],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"However, there are undoubtedly some wrong ways,","start":73.62,"end":76.72,"score":0.943,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-048-009-p02","sourceId":"b4-048-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":2,"parts":3,"wordRange":[7,12],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"and you can be sure","start":76.963,"end":78.21,"score":0.969,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-048-009-p03","sourceId":"b4-048-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":3,"parts":3,"wordRange":[12,31],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"that none of our five advisers would have suggested sinking all (or perhaps any) of your money into Periwigs.","start":78.38,"end":86.44,"score":0.97,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-048-010","sourceId":"b4-048-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,5],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"So what should you do?","start":87.243,"end":88.99,"score":0.989,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-048-011","sourceId":"b4-048-011","sourceIndex":10,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,18],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"We'll assume that you have sorted out the basics--like mortgages, pensions, insurance and access to sufficient cash reserves.","start":89.762,"end":98.6,"score":0.942,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-048-012","sourceId":"b4-048-012","sourceIndex":11,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,8],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"You should then establish your own individual aims.","start":99.48,"end":102.22,"score":0.933,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-048-013","sourceId":"b4-048-013","sourceIndex":12,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,13],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"These are partly a matter of personal circumstances, partly a matter of psychology.","start":102.743,"end":108.71,"score":0.977,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-048-014-p01","sourceId":"b4-048-014","sourceIndex":13,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,16],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"For instance, if you are older you have less time to recover from any major losses,","start":110.51,"end":116.14,"score":0.989,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-048-014-p02","sourceId":"b4-048-014","sourceIndex":13,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[16,26],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"and you may well wish to boost your pension income.","start":116.6,"end":119.58,"score":0.985,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-048-015","sourceId":"b4-048-015","sourceIndex":14,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,12],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"So preserving your capital and generating extra income are your main priorities.","start":120.243,"end":126.32,"score":0.983,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-048-016-p01","sourceId":"b4-048-016","sourceIndex":15,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,16],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"In this case, you'd probably construct a portfolio with some shares (but not high risk ones),","start":127.16,"end":133.57,"score":0.929,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-048-016-p02","sourceId":"b4-048-016","sourceIndex":15,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[16,33],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"along with gilts, cash deposits, and perhaps convertibles or the income shares of split capital investment trusts.","start":134.0,"end":142.4,"score":0.932,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-048-017-p01","sourceId":"b4-048-017","sourceIndex":16,"part":1,"parts":3,"wordRange":[0,10],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"If you are younger, and in a solid financial position,","start":143.64,"end":147.04,"score":0.997,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-048-017-p02","sourceId":"b4-048-017","sourceIndex":16,"part":2,"parts":3,"wordRange":[10,19],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"you may decide to take an aggressive approach--but only","start":147.34,"end":151.06,"score":0.979,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-048-017-p03","sourceId":"b4-048-017","sourceIndex":16,"part":3,"parts":3,"wordRange":[19,34],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"if you're blessed with a sanguine disposition and won't suffer sleepless nights over share prices.","start":151.22,"end":157.36,"score":0.917,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-048-018-p01","sourceId":"b4-048-018","sourceIndex":17,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,7],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"If you recognize yourself in this description,","start":158.54,"end":161.322,"score":0.968,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-048-018-p02","sourceId":"b4-048-018","sourceIndex":17,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[7,24],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"you might include a couple of heady growth stocks in your portfolio, alongside your more pedestrian investments.","start":161.52,"end":168.49,"score":0.961,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-048-019","sourceId":"b4-048-019","sourceIndex":18,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,17],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Once you have decided on your investment aims you can then decide where to put your money.","start":169.53,"end":175.05,"score":0.979,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-048-020-p01","sourceId":"b4-048-020","sourceIndex":19,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,17],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The golden rule here is spread your risk--if you put all of your money into Periwigs International,","start":175.83,"end":183.04,"score":0.953,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-048-020-p02","sourceId":"b4-048-020","sourceIndex":19,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[17,26],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"you're setting yourself up as a hostage to fortune.","start":183.48,"end":186.76,"score":0.956,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]}]}
